The beam size of proton and heavy ion minibeams increases with depth due to multiple small angle scattering. The dose modulation within the tumor is described by the σ/ctc ratio. Using a Gaussian as first order approximation for the lateral beam distribution from small angle scattering σsc as well as the initial beam size σ0, the beam size1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
